{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43328","headline":"出笼鹘 · 濮阳瓘","name":"出笼鹘","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"玉镞分花袖，金铃出彩笼。\n摇心长捧日，逸翰镇生风。\n一点青霄里，千声碧落中。\n星眸随狡兔，霜爪落飞鸿。\n每念提携力，常怀搏击功。\n以君能惠好，不敢没遥空。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"濮阳瓘","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_43328.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_43328","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}